            "review_title": "Review at Đặc Sản Bình Định Quy Nhơn Ông Bảy",
            "review_text": "Ni Ni\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThe food in Quy Nhon is very delicious, the people are friendly\nJan 2024 • Business\nGoing on a business trip to Quy Nhon to buy Quy Nhon specialties at this store, they are very supportive, reasonably priced and honest. I really like eating banh it at this store, but the store owner said it can only be preserved for a short time, so I don't buy much. Nem, tre, banh it, shrimp spring rolls, fried fish cakes here are very delicious\nValue\nService\nFood\nShow original\nWritten January 10, 2024",
